OpenSlip is an independent open-hardware and open-firmware project for
walkway traction measurement. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
derived from any commercial tribometer brand.

Hardware referenced in this repository (including the LilyGO T-Motor
development board, TMC2209, MT6816, and SSD1306 OLED) remains the property
of their respective manufacturers. Pin maps and board facts are documented
here for interoperability. See:

  https://github.com/Xinyuan-LilyGO/T-Motor

Firmware depends on third-party Arduino libraries (TMCStepper, AccelStepper,
U8g2, OneButton) under their own licenses.
